---
source: tests/golden/notifications.rs
expression: "norm::text(&out)"
---
provider: waha (WhatsApp (WAHA))

## minimal config
{
  "chat_id": "4712345678@c.us",
  "server": "http://waha:3000",
  "session": "default"
}

### down
POST http://waha:3000/api/sendText
(json)
{
  "chatId": "4712345678@c.us",
  "session": "default",
  "text": "🔴 Payments API is down — HTTP 503 (after 3 retries)\nhttps://vv.example/monitors/7"
}

### up
POST http://waha:3000/api/sendText
(json)
{
  "chatId": "4712345678@c.us",
  "session": "default",
  "text": "🟢 Payments API is back up — down for 12m 4s\nhttps://vv.example/monitors/7"
}

